# NOTICE

## Reference Data Attribution

This project's governance validation scenarios reference publicly available
open datasets published by **Equinor ASA**:

- **Volve Field Dataset** — open oil & gas field data from the North Sea
  (production data, well logs, WITSML real-time drilling data, seismic,
  reservoir models). Reference tables: `witsml_bha_runs`,
  `witsml_drilling_messages`, `drilling_telemetry`, `well_logs_inventory`,
  `production_data_daily`, `production_data_monthly`.
- **Northern Lights CO₂ Storage Project (31/5-7 Eos well)** — open well data
  for CO₂ storage research (drilling & completion, directional surveys, LWD,
  wireline logs, formation pressure, well tests, core data).

Neither the raw datasets nor any proprietary derivatives are included in this
repository. Only catalog structure, schema descriptions, and governance test
scenarios are referenced. Please consult Equinor's open-data license terms
before redistributing the underlying datasets.

